# ── Cloudflare Pages Production Environment Variables ─────────────────────────
#
# IMPORTANT: Set VITE_API_URL in the Cloudflare Pages dashboard
#   Settings → Environment Variables → Production
#   so the real URL is never committed to source control.
#
# Required variables:
#   VITE_API_URL          - Your Render backend URL
#                           e.g. https://nexos-api.onrender.com
#   VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID - Your Google OAuth client ID (safe to commit)
#
# Uncomment and fill in for local production preview (`npm run preview`):
# VITE_API_URL=https://nexos-api.onrender.com
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=1080363277355-12nq3rf5nou0pn1sb9g6racb3ioaua8l.apps.googleusercontent.com
